@startuml
title 用问题验证切块，而不是先猜 chunk_size

skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam defaultFontName "PingFang SC"
skinparam defaultFontSize 14
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 8
skinparam ArrowColor #475569
skinparam rectangle {
  BorderColor #475569
  BackgroundColor #F8FAFC
}

rectangle "真实问题集\n问题 + 最小充分证据 span" as questions #E0F2FE
rectangle "结构解析\n标题、段落、表格、代码、列表" as parse
rectangle "候选切块策略\n结构块 / 父子块 / 邻接扩展" as chunk #FEF3C7
rectangle "检索回放\n固定 embedding、top-k 与过滤" as replay
rectangle "证据覆盖检查\n召回了吗？条件完整吗？噪声多少？" as cover
rectangle "生成隔离评测\n只用标注证据，再测答案" as answer #DCFCE7
rectangle "版本化发布\nparser + chunker + index version" as release #DCFCE7

questions --> parse
parse --> chunk
chunk --> replay
replay --> cover
cover --> answer
answer --> release
cover --> chunk : 缺条件或噪声过多

note right of cover
  chunk 大小只是实验参数；
  最小充分证据才是验收对象
end note
@enduml
